### Scorekeeper API - REST Client requests
### Install the REST Client extension: humao.rest-client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@cookie = wordle_session=test-user

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ============================================================================
### GAMEPLAY
### ============================================================================

### Submit Guess (cookie auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/guess
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "puzzle_date_iso_day": "2026-01-15",
  "word_guessed": "crane"
}

### Get Game Progress (cookie auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/game/2026-01-15
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Get History (requires JWT)
# @name history
GET {{baseUrl}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv JWT}}

### ============================================================================
### PUZZLES
### ============================================================================

### Get Puzzles (requires JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/puzzles
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv JWT}}

### Get Puzzles with date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/puzzles?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv JWT}}

### Get Single Puzzle
GET {{baseUrl}}/puzzles/2026-01-15
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv JWT}}

### Set Puzzle (admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/puzzles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv JWT}}

{
  "date": "2026-02-15",
  "word": "crane"
}

### Set Puzzle with random word (admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/puzzles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv JWT}}

{
  "date": "2026-02-16",
  "set_random_unused_word": true
}

### Clear Puzzle Cache (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/puzzles/cache/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv JWT}}

### ============================================================================
### PROFILE
### ============================================================================

### Get Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv JWT}}

### Update Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv JWT}}

{
  "displayName": "WordMaster42"
}
